        "changed_premise": "The earlier conditions said the statement was source-derived and had not been executed as a control. A read-index control was executed afterwards and is now cited, so the conditions no longer claim the boundary is unobserved. The statement itself is unchanged; a second entry carrying the same statement with the receipt also exists, and either can be cited.",
